.9.1절) 스래싱을 조절하는 방법은 아무래도 좀 어색하다. 페이","words":[{"text":"ing)","x":281,"y":1643,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"시에","x":355,"y":1640,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"유용하지만(10.9.1절)","x":425,"y":1640,"width":282,"height":38},{"text":"스래싱을","x":721,"y":1641,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"조절하는","x":853,"y":1640,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"방법은","x":988,"y":1640,"width":94,"height":34},{"text":"아무래도","x":1095,"y":1640,"width":131,"height":33},{"text":"좀","x":1239,"y":1641,"width":34,"height":31},{"text":"어색하다.","x":1288,"y":1640,"width":140,"height":34},{"text":"페이","x":1445,"y":1639,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"지 폴트 빈도(PFF) 방식은 보다 더 직접적으로 스래싱을 조절한다.","words":[{"text":"지","x":281,"y":1697,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"폴트","x":321,"y":1699,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"빈도(PFF)","x":394,"y":1698,"width":136,"height":36},{"text":"방식은","x":544,"y":1698,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"보다","x":642,"y":1698,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"더","x":713,"y":1698,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"직접적으로","x":753,"y":1698,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"스래싱을","x":913,"y":1697,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"조절한다.","x":1048,"y":1696,"width":136,"height":34}]},{"text":"지금 다루려는 문제는 어떻게 스래싱을 막을 수 있을 것인가이다. 스래싱이란 페이","words":[{"text":"지금","x":339,"y":1754,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"다루려는","x":410,"y":1755,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"문제는","x":540,"y":1755,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"어떻게","x":643,"y":1755,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"스래싱을","x":744,"y":1755,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"막을","x":877,"y":1754,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":950,"y":1755,"width":32,"height":33},{"text":"있을","x":998,"y":1754,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"것인가이다.","x":1073,"y":1753,"width":169,"height":35},{"text":"스래싱이란","x":1260,"y":1754,"width":171,"height":34},{"text":"페이","x":1445,"y":1754,"width":61,"height":35}]},{"text":"지 폴트율이 높은 것을 의미한다. 우리가 원하는 것은 페이지 폴트율을 조절하는 것인데,","words":[{"text":"지","x":281,"y":1812,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"폴트율이","